Subject: [PATCH] winemac.drv, win32u: Add the D3DMetal bridge.

Unchanged from hsr-wine-d3dmetal patches/wine-p3/0002-d3dmetal-bridge.patch (LGPL-2.1-or-later,
derived from CrossOver FOSS 26.3): CAMetalLayer client surfaces for D3DMetal in winemac.drv,
CX_ACTIVE_GRAPHICS_BACKEND in win32u, and the shm dummy surface (CX HACK 23950).

Topic: d3dmetal
